tton is pressed (Issue #568).\\n01999| func _on_next_level_pressed(level_path: String) -> void:\\n02000| \\t_log_to_file(\\\"Next Level button pressed: %s\\\" % level_path)\\n\\n(File has more lines. Use 'offset' parameter to read beyond line 2000)\\n</file>\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Now I need to look for where unlocks are handled. Let me check the UnlockManager and see how unlocks are determined.\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-bbe6c8a60f0089a9\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"glob\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/UnlockManager.*\\\"}\"}}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-bbe6c8a60f0089a9\",\"content\":\"No files found\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Let me search for unlock-related files more broadly.\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-b9b8d0cc97831f99\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"glob\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/*unlock*.gd\\\"}\"}}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-b9b8d0cc97831f99\",\"content\":\"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_unlock_table_menu.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_unlock_manager.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_laser_sight_unlock.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_fine_motor_skills_unlock.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_combat_disposition_unlock.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_armory_unlock_progress.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_armory_unlock.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/tests/unit/test_armored_skin_unlock.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/scripts/ui/unlock_table_menu.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/scripts/autoload/unlock_manager.gd\\n/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/experiments/test_armory_unlock.gd\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Let 