rding to the issue, we need to also unlock an \\\"offensive grenade\\\" (наступательная граната) when completing the Building level at any rank (even F).\\n\\nLooking at the grenade types referenced in the file:\\n- Line 31: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1\\n- Line 73: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.DEFENSIVE = 2 (F-1 grenade)\\n- Line 79: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3\\n- Line 121: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.DRONE = 4\\n\\nThe issue mentions \\\"наступательная граната\\\" which translates to \\\"offensive grenade\\\". Looking at the grenade types, AGGRESSION_GAS (type 3) seems like the most likely candidate for an offensive grenade, as \\\"aggression\\\" relates to offense.\\n\\nLet me check if there are any other references to offensive grenades in the codebase to confirm.\\n\\nActually, let me re-read the issue more carefully. It says \\\"дробовик и наступательная граната\\\" - shotgun AND offensive grenade.\\n\\nThe shotgun is already unlocked by the Building level (line 30), so that part is correct.\\n\\nWe need to add the offensive grenade to the Building level unlock conditions.\\n\\nBased on the grenade types I see:\\n- FRAG = 1 (Fragmentation grenade)\\n- DEFENSIVE = 2 (F-1 grenade, described as defensive)\\n- AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (Aggression gas - likely offensive)\\n- DRONE = 4 (Drone grenade)\\n\\nSo AGGRESSION_GAS (type 3) is probably the offensive grenade referred to in the issue.\\n\\nLet me check if there are any comments or other references that might confirm this.\\n\\nLooking at line 79: `# GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (Issue #1624 req.4)`\\n\\nAnd line 73: `# GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.DEFENSIVE = 2 (F-1 grenade, Issue #1000 req.6)`\\n\\nThe DEFENSIVE grenade is explicitly called \\\"defensive\\\", so by contrast, AGGRESSION_GAS would be the offensive one.\\n\\nTherefore, I need to add grenade type 3 (AGGRESSION_GAS) to the Building level unlock conditions.\\n\\nThe current Building level unlocks grenade type 1 (FRAG). I need to add type 3 as well.\\n\\nSo the change should be:\\n```\\n\\t\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\": {\\n\\t\\t\\\"min_rank\\\": \\\"F\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"weapons\\\": [\\\"shotgun\\\"],\\n\\t\\t\\\"grenades\\\": [1, 3],    # Added AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) for Issue #1826\\n\\t\\t\\\"active_items\\\": []\\n\\t},\\n```\\n\\nLet me make this change.\\n\\n\",\"reasoning_details\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"Looking at the issue description: \\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\"\\n\\nThis translates to: \\\"Shotgun and offensive grenade should unlock when completing the Building level at any rank (even F)\\\"\\n\\nLooking at the unlock_manager.gd file, I can see the current unlock conditions for BuildingLevel.tscn:\\n\\nLines 28-33:\\n```\\n\\t\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\": {\\n\\t\\t\\\"min_rank\\\": \\\"F\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"weapons\\\": [\\\"shotgun\\\"],\\n\\t\\t\\\"grenades\\\": [1],    # GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1 (Issue #1000 req.1)\\n\\t\\t\\\"active_items\\\": []\\n\\t},\\n```\\n\\nCurrently, the Building level unlocks:\\n- Weapon: shotgun (min_rank: F)\\n- Grenade: FRAG (type 1) (min_rank: F)\\n\\nAccording to the issue, we need to also unlock an \\\"offensive grenade\\\" (наступательная граната) when completing the Building level at any rank (even F).\\n\\nLooking at the grenade types referenced in the file:\\n- Line 31: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1\\n- Line 73: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.DEFENSIVE = 2 (F-1 grenade)\\n- Line 79: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3\\n- Line 121: GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.DRONE = 4\\n\\nThe issue mentions \\\"наступательная граната\\\" which translates to \\\"offensive grenade\\\". Looking at the grenade types, AGGRESSION_GAS (type 3) seems like the most likely candidate for an offensive grenade, as \\\"aggression\\\" relates to offense.\\n\\nLet me check if there are any other references to offensive grenades in the codebase to confirm.\\n\\nActually, let me re-read the issue more carefully. It says \\\"дробовик и наступательная граната\\\" - shotgun AND offensive grenade.\\n\\nThe shotgun is already unlocked by the Building level (line 30), so that part is correct.\\n\\nWe need to add the offensive grenade to the Building level unlock conditions.\\n\\nBased on the grenade types I see:\\n- FRAG = 1 (Fragmentation grenade)\\n- DEFENSIVE = 2 (F-1 grenade, described as defensive)\\n- AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (Aggression gas - likely offensive)\\n- DRONE = 4 (Drone grenade)\\n\\nSo AGGRESSION_GAS (type 3) is probably the offensive grenade referred to in the issue.\\n\\nLet me check if there are any comments or other references that might confirm this.\\n\\nLooking at line 79: `# GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (Issue #1624 req.4)`\\n\\nAnd line 73: `# GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.DEFENSIVE = 2 (F-1 grenade, Issue #1000 req.6)`\\n\\nThe DEFENSIVE grenade is explicitly called \\\"defensive\\\", so by contrast, AGGRESSION_GAS would be the offensive one.\\n\\nTherefore, I need to add grenade type 3 (AGGRESSION_GAS) to the Building level unlock conditions.\\n\\nThe current Building level unlocks grenade type 1 (FRAG). I need to add type 3 as well.\\n\\nSo the change should be:\\n```\\n\\t\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\": {\\n\\t\\t\\\"min_rank\\\": \\\"F\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"weapons\\\": [\\\"shotgun\\\"],\\n\\t\\t\\\"grenades\\\": [1, 3],    # Added AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) for Issue #1826\\n\\t\\t\\\"active_items\\\": []\\n\\t},\\n```\\n\\nLet me make this change.\\n\\n\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},\"finish_reason\":null,\"native_finish_reason\":null}]}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"gen-1776272168-E9OI1xYfZbyp60ljaxwE\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1776272168,\"model\":\"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b-20230311:free\",\"provider\":\"Nvidia\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"c