y there:\\\\n- Shotgun is in weapons array\\\\n- Grenade type 3 (offensive grenade) is in grenades array\\\\n\\\\nWait, let me re-read the issue more carefully. It says \\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis translates to: \\\\\\\"Shotgun and offensive grenade should be unlocked by completing the Building level on any rank (even on F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the current code:\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\\\\\": {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [1, 3],    # GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) (Issue #1000 req.1, Issue #1826)\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n},\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nThis looks correct already. The shotgun is in the weapons array, and the offensive grenade (type 3) is in the grenades array. The min_rank is \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\" which means any rank (F or higher).\\\\n\\\\nLet me check if there's another entry for BuildingLevel that might be overriding this:\\\\n\\\\nI see there's also:\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn:S\\\\\\\": {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"S\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"silenced_pistol\\\\\\\"],  # Issue #1000 req.2\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n},\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nThis is a different condition - it's for BuildingLevel.tscn:S (which means Building level completed at S rank). This unlocks the silenced pistol, not the shotgun or offensive grenade.\\\\n\\\\nSo the base BuildingLevel.tscn (without rank suffix) should unlock shotgun and offensive grenades at rank F or higher.\\\\n\\\\nLet me verify what grenade type 3 is:\\\\nFrom the comment: \\\\\\\"GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.