n            \\\"weapons\\\": [\\\"shotgun\\\"],\\n            \\\"grenades\\\": [1, 3],    # GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) (Issue #1000 req.1, Issue #1826)\\n            \\\"active_items\\\": []\\n        },\\n\\n The issue says that both shotgun and offensive grenade should be unlocked by completing the Building level at any rank (even F).\\n Currently, the BuildingLevel.tscn (without rank) has min_rank \\\"F\\\", which means any completion (even F) will unlock the shotgun and grenades [1,3].\\n\\n However, note that the offensive grenade is represented by 3 (as per the comment). The issue only mentions offensive grenade, but the current code also includes frag (1).\\n\\n Let's check the issue again: it says \\\"дробовик и наступательная граната\\\" (shotgun and offensive grenade). So we only need shotgun and offensive grenade.\\n\\n But wait, the current code for BuildingLevel.tscn already includes both shotgun and grenades [1,3] (which includes offensive grenade as 3).\\n\\n However, note that the issue says \\\"при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\" meaning that the Building level must be completed at any rank (including F) to unlock these.\\n\\n The current condition for BuildingLevel.tscn (without rank) is set to min_rank \\\"F\\\", which is the lowest rank, so any completion (F, D, C, B, A, A+, S) will meet the condition.\\n\\n Therefore, the current code already satisfies the issue? But why is there an uncommitted change?\\n\\n Let's look at the uncommitted change in the file. We haven't staged it, so let's see what the change is.\\n\\n We can do:\\n   git diff scripts/autoload/unlock_manager.gd\\n\\n But note: the user said there are uncommitted changes. Let's check.\\n\\n\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},\"finish_reason\":null,\"native_finish_reason\":null}]}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"gen-1776272320-y5IrbFO8ghCwnTlmwy4D\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"cre