\\nСуди…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\nСуди…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\nСуди…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\nСуди…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\n…….”\\\\n\\\\nThe issue is in Russian, but I can understand it: \\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis translates to: \\\\\\\"Shotgun and offensive grenade should be unlocked by completing the Building level on any rank (even on F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the unlock_manager.gd file, I can see the relevant section:\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\\\\\": {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [1, 3],    # GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) (Issue #1000 req.1, Issue #1826)\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n},\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nAccording to the issue, the shotgun (weapon) and offensive grenade (grenade type 3) should be unlocked by completing the Building level on any rank (even F). \\\\n\\\\nLooking at the current code:\\\\n- Shotgun is correctly listed under weapons: [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"]\\\\n- Grenades include [1, 3] where:\\\\n  - 1 is FRAG (fragmentation grenade)\\\\n  - 3 is AGGRESSION_GAS (offensive grenade)\\\\n\\\\nSo it seems like the shotgun is already correctly configured to unlock at rank F (any rank), and the offensive grenade (type 3) is also already included.\\\\n\\\\nBut let me double-check the issue description again. It says both shotgun AND offensive grenade should unlock when completing Building level on any rank (even F).\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the current code, both are already there:\\\\n- Shotgun is in weapons array\\\\n- Grenade type 3 (offensive grenade) is in grenades array\\\\n\\\\nWait, let me re-read the issue more carefully. It says \\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis translates to: \\\\\\\"Shotgun and offensive grenade should be unlocked by completing the Building level on any rank (even on F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the current code:\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\\\\\": {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [1, 3],    # GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) (Issue #1000 req.1, Issue #1826)\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n},\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nThis looks correct already. The shotgun is in the weapons array, and the offensive grenade (type 3) is in the grenades array. The min_rank is \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\" which means any rank (F or higher).\\\\n\\\\nLet me check if there's another entry for BuildingLevel that might be overriding this:\\\\n\\\\nI see there's also:\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn:S\\\\\\\": {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"S\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"silenced_pistol\\\\\\\"],  # Issue #1000 req.2\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n},\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nThis is a different condition - it's for BuildingLevel.tscn:S (which means Building level completed at S rank). This unlocks the silenced pistol, not the shotgun or offensive grenade.\\\\n\\\\nSo the base BuildingLevel.tscn (without rank suffix) should unlock shotgun and offensive grenades at rank F or higher.\\\\n\\\\nLet me verify what grenade type 3 is:\\\\nFrom the comment: \\\\\\\"GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nSo grenade type 3 is indeed the offensive grenade.\\\\n\\\\nIt looks like the configuration is already correct! But the issue exists, so maybe I'm misunderstanding something.\\\\n\\\\nLet me re-read the issue description once more: \\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nMaybe the issue is that currently it's NOT set up this way? Let me check if perhaps the shotgun or offensive grenade is missing from the BuildingLevel.tscn entry.\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the code again:\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\\\\\": {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [1, 3],    # GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) (Issue #1000 req.1, Issue #1826)\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n},\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nBoth are there. Shotgun in weapons, offensive grenade (type 3) in grenades.\\\\n\\\\nUnless... maybe the issue is that the offensive grenade should be JUST the offensive grenade (type 3) alone, not with the frag grenade (type 1)? But the issue says \\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната\\\\\\\" which translates to \\\\\\\"shotgun and offensive grenade\\\\\\\" - it's asking for BOTH to be unlocked.\\\\n\\\\nLet me check if there's a typo or if I'm missing something. \\\\n\\\\nActually, let me look at the issue description again. It says to update the unlocks so that shotgun AND offensive grenade unlock when completing Building level on any rank.\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the current code, it seems like it's already set up that way. But since there's an issue filed, maybe it's NOT working correctly?\\\\n\\\\nLet me check if there's a duplicate entry or something overriding it.\\\\n\\\\nActually, wait. Let me check if the comment is misleading me. The comment says:\\\\n```\\\\n# GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) (Issue #1000 req.1, Issue #1826)\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nThis suggests that issue #1826 was already supposed to be addressed in issue #1000. But apparently it's not working correctly.\\\\n\\\\nLet me think about what might be wrong. Maybe the issue is that although the offensive grenade (type 3) is listed, it's not actually unlocking properly in the game?\\\\n\\\\nOr maybe I misunderstood which grenade is the \\\\\\\"offensive grenade\\\\\\\".\\\\n\\\\nLet me double-check the comment: \\\\\\\"GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nSo yes, type 3 is offensive grenade.\\\\n\\\\nWait, let me re-read the issue one more time very carefully:\\\\n\\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\\\\\"Shotgun and offensive grenade should be unlocked by completing the Building level on any rank (even on F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nMaybe the issue is that it's currently set to require MORE than just F rank? Let me check the min_rank value.\\\\n\\\\nIt says: \\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAnd looking at the _is_rank_sufficient function:\\\\n```\\\\nfunc _is_rank_sufficient(rank: String, min_rank: String) -> bool:\\\\n\\\\tif min_rank == \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\":\\\\n\\\\t\\\\t# F or higher means any completed run counts\\\\n\\\\t\\\\treturn not rank.is_empty()\\\\n\\\\treturn not _is_rank_better(min_rank, rank)  # min_rank is not better than rank => rank >= min_rank\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nSo if min_rank is \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\", it returns true if rank is not empty (meaning any completion, regardless of rank).\\\\n\\\\nThis looks correct.\\\\n\\\\nLet me think about what might actually be wrong. Maybe I should look for recent changes or check if there's a discrepancy.\\\\n\\\\nActually, let me approach this differently. Let me assume the issue is valid and see what might be wrong.\\\\n\\\\nPerhaps the issue is that the offensive grenade (type 3) is NOT currently in the BuildingLevel.tscn entry, and the comment is misleading or outdated.\\\\n\\\\nLet me strip out the comment and just look at the data:\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\\\\\": {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [1, 3],\\\\n\\\\t\\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n},\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nThis shows grenades [1, 3] which includes both frag (1) and offensive grenade (3).\\\\n\\\\nBut maybe the issue is asking for ONLY the offensive grenade (3) to be there, not both? Let me re-read the issue.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохожде
