\\\t\\\\t\\\\tGrenadeType.DEFENSIVE: names.append(\\\\\\\"Defensive\\\\\\\")\\\\n./scripts/components/grenadier_grenade_component.gd:\\\\t\\\\tGrenadeType.FLASHBANG: return _flashbang_scene\\\\n./scripts/components/grenadier_grenade_component.gd:\\\\t\\\\tGrenadeType.OFFENSIVE: return _offensive_scene\\\\n\\\"}}]},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Let's do it.\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool-call\\\",\\\"toolCallId\\\":\\\"chatcmpl-tool-8d2cc79bb5270ee4\\\",\\\"toolName\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo \\\\\\\"UnlockManager script reviewed; no changes needed.\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Confirm review completion\\\\n\\\\n<tool_call>\\\\n<function=read>\\\",\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776272033963/scripts/components/grenadier_grenade_component.gd\\\"}}]},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool-result\\\",\\\"toolCallId\\\":\\\"chatcmpl-tool-8d2cc79bb5270ee4\\\",\\\"toolName\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"output\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"UnlockManager script reviewed; no changes needed.\\\\n\\\"}}]},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"We are given that the issue is: \\\\\\\"дробовик и наступательная граната должен открываться при прохождении карты Здание на любой ранг (даже на F)\\\\\\\"\\\\nTranslation: \\\\\\\"Shotgun and offensive grenade should be unlocked by completing the Building level on any rank (even F)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the unlock_manager.gd file, we see the following condition for BuildingLevel.tscn:\\\\n\\\\n  \\\\\\\"res://scenes/levels/BuildingLevel.tscn\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"min_rank\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"weapons\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"],\\\\n    \\\\\\\"grenades\\\\\\\": [1, 3],    # GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.FRAG = 1, GrenadeManager.GrenadeType.AGGRESSION_GAS = 3 (offensive grenade) (Issue #1000 req.1, Issue #1826)\\\\n    \\\\\\\"active_items\\\\\\\": []\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\nThis condition already has:\\\\n  - min_rank: \\\\\\\"F\\\\\\\" (which means any rank, including F, is sufficient)\\\\n  - weapons: [\\\\\\\"shotgun\\\\\\\"]\\\\n  - grenades: [1, 3] with a comment that 3 is the offensive grenade (AGGRESSION_GAS)\\\\n\\\\nHowever, note that the issue says \\\\\\\"наступательная граната\\\\\\\" which translates to \\\\\\\"offensive grenade\\\\\\\". In the comment, it says that 3 is the offensive grenade.\\\\n\\\\nBut wait: the issue says that both the shotgun and the offensive grenade should be unlocked by completing the Building level on any rank (even F). The current condition already does that.\\\\n\\\\nHowever, let's check the grenade types in the GrenadierGrenadeComponent:\\\\n\\\\n  enum GrenadeType { FLASHBANG, OFFENSIVE, DEFENSIVE }\\\\n\\\\nSo:\\\\n  FLASHBANG = 0\\\\n  OFFENSIVE = 1\\\\n  DEFENSIVE = 2\\\\n\\\\nBut in the unlock condition, we have grenades: [1, 3]. The comment says:\\\\n  1 = FRAG (which is not in the enum above) and 3 = AGGRESSION_GAS (offensive grenade).\\\\n\\\\nThis discrepancy suggests that the GrenadeType enum in GrenadierGrenadeComponent might not be the same as the one used in GrenadeManager.\\\\n\\\\nLet's check the GrenadeManager to see the actual enum.\\\\n\\\\nWe don't have the GrenadeManager file in the provided file list, but we can search for it.\\\\n\\\\nAlternatively, note that the issue is about the offensive grenade. In the unlock condition, we have 3 for offensive grenade. But in the GrenadierGrenadeComponent, OFFENSIVE is 1.\\\\n\\\\nThis suggests that the GrenadeManager uses a different numbering.\\\\n\\\\nLet's search for GrenadeManager in the codebase.\\\\n\\\\nWe'll do a quick search for GrenadeManager.gd.\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool-call\\\",\\\"toolCallId\\\":\\\"chatcmpl-tool-95d35737347ff983\\\",\\\"toolName\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"find . -name \\\\\\\"*GrenadeManager*\\\\\\\